# Icon Storage Directory

This directory stores all system icons and custom icons.

## Directory Structure:

- `system/` - System icons (settings, dashboard, users, etc.)
- `theme/` - Theme-related icons (color palette, brush, etc.)
- `custom/` - Custom icons uploaded by admin
- `social/` - Social media icons (Facebook, LINE, Twitter, etc.)
- `flags/` - Country flags

## Supported Formats:
- SVG (recommended for scalability)
- PNG (with transparency)
- JPG (for photos)
- WebP (for optimization)

## Usage:
Upload your icons here and use the Icon helper or component to display them.
